{"vid":"ODAF2lQYAkk","source":"ODAF2lQYAkk.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0,"txt":"Hot work is any activity that produces"},{"t":2.6,"txt":"heat, sparks, flame, or enough energy to"},{"t":5.6,"txt":"ignite combustible or flammable"},{"t":8,"txt":"materials."},{"t":9.2,"txt":"Common examples. Common examples of hot"},{"t":12.2,"txt":"work include welding, gas cutting,"},{"t":15.1,"txt":"grinding, brazing, soldering, flame"},{"t":18.2,"txt":"heating, gouging, metal drilling with"},{"t":20.9,"txt":"sparks, thermal spraying, torch on"},{"t":23.6,"txt":"waterproofing, and any work using an"},{"t":26,"txt":"open flame or creating sparks. Main"},{"t":29.3,"txt":"hazard. Hot work presents serious"},{"t":32,"txt":"hazards including fire, explosion, toxic"},{"t":36,"txt":"fumes and gases, burns from hot metal"},{"t":38.9,"txt":"and sparks, eye injuries from arc flash,"},{"t":42,"txt":"electric shock, oxygen deficiency in"},{"t":44.7,"txt":"confined spaces, property damage,"},{"t":47.5,"txt":"environmental pollution, and excessive"},{"t":50,"txt":"noise. Possible consequences. Failing to"},{"t":53.2,"txt":"manage hot work safely can result in"},{"t":56.1,"txt":"serious injury or fatality, fire spread,"},{"t":59.5,"txt":"equipment damage, production shutdown,"},{"t":62.1,"txt":"environmental contamination, financial"},{"t":64.8,"txt":"loss, and legal action. Before starting"},{"t":67.6,"txt":"hot work. Before beginning any hot work"},{"t":70.4,"txt":"activity, you must once obtain an"},{"t":73.6,"txt":"approved hot work permit, two, conduct a"},{"t":76.8,"txt":"job safety analysis or JSA,"},{"t":79.7,"txt":"three, identify all hazards, four,"},{"t":83.1,"txt":"remove combustible materials within at"},{"t":85.7,"txt":"least 10 to 15 m where practical, five,"},{"t":89.3,"txt":"cover nearby combustible materials with"},{"t":91.8,"txt":"fire resistant blankets, six, check gas"},{"t":95.3,"txt":"cylinders and hoses for leaks, seven,"},{"t":98.8,"txt":"ensure adequate ventilation,"},{"t":101.2,"txt":"eight, test the atmosphere if working in"},{"t":104.1,"txt":"a confined space,"},{"t":106.2,"txt":"nine, barricade the work area,"},{"t":109.4,"txt":"10,"},{"t":110.5,"txt":"display warning signs,"},{"t":112.8,"txt":"11,"},{"t":114.1,"txt":"keep emergency exits clear, 12, ensure a"},{"t":117.8,"txt":"trained fire watch is available."},{"t":120.3,"txt":"13. Verify emergency contact numbers."},{"t":123.7,"txt":"Required PPE. All personnel involved in"},{"t":127.2,"txt":"hot work must wear the correct personal"},{"t":129.5,"txt":"protective equipment including a welding"},{"t":132.4,"txt":"helmet with the correct shade lens,"},{"t":134.5,"txt":"safety goggles, face shield when"},{"t":136.6,"txt":"grinding, leather welding gloves, flame"},{"t":139.5,"txt":"resistant coveralls, safety shoes,"},{"t":142.1,"txt":"hearing protection, respiratory"},{"t":144,"txt":"protection when required, safety harness"},{"t":146.4,"txt":"for work at height, and a high"},{"t":148,"txt":"visibility vest. Fire prevention. To"},{"t":151.2,"txt":"prevent fire during hot work, keep"},{"t":153.5,"txt":"suitable fire extinguishers nearby."},{"t":156.4,"txt":"Inspect all equipment before use. Never"},{"t":159.5,"txt":"weld near flammable liquids or gases. Do"},{"t":162.6,"txt":"not use damaged cables. Keep cylinders"},{"t":165.5,"txt":"upright and secured. Store oxygen and"},{"t":168.4,"txt":"fuel gas cylinders separately. Close"},{"t":171.1,"txt":"cylinder valves after use and prevent"},{"t":173.5,"txt":"sparks from traveling to nearby areas."},{"t":176.4,"txt":"Fire watch duties. The designated fire"},{"t":178.6,"txt":"watch must stay in the work area during"},{"t":181.4,"txt":"all hot work. Watch for smoke, sparks,"},{"t":184.8,"txt":"and hidden fires. Know how to operate"},{"t":187.4,"txt":"fire extinguishers. Raise the alarm"},{"t":189.8,"txt":"immediately if required and continue"},{"t":192.4,"txt":"fire watch for at least 30 minutes after"},{"t":194.7,"txt":"completion or longer if required by the"},{"t":197.5,"txt":"permit. Safety rules. Remember these"},{"t":200.7,"txt":"non-negotiable safety rules. No hot work"},{"t":203.8,"txt":"without a valid permit. No smoking in"},{"t":206.6,"txt":"the hot work area. Never bypass safety"},{"t":209.5,"txt":"procedures. Only trained and authorized"},{"t":212.3,"txt":"workers may perform hot work. Always"},{"t":215.2,"txt":"inspect equipment before use and keep"},{"t":218.5,"txt":"the workplace clean and organized."},{"t":220.8,"txt":"Emergency actions. In the event of an"},{"t":223.6,"txt":"emergency, stop work immediately. Sound"},{"t":227,"txt":"the alarm. Use the correct fire"},{"t":229.1,"txt":"extinguisher if it is safe to do so,"},{"t":232.2,"txt":"evacuate if the fire cannot be"},{"t":234.9,"txt":"controlled. Inform the supervisor, call"},{"t":238.2,"txt":"the emergency response team, and provide"},{"t":241.1,"txt":"first aid to injured persons. After"},{"t":243.9,"txt":"completing hot work, once hot work is"},{"t":246.8,"txt":"complete, you must switch off all"},{"t":249.6,"txt":"equipment. Close gas cylinder valves,"},{"t":252.8,"txt":"disconnect the power supply, inspect the"},{"t":255.3,"txt":"area carefully, remove all waste"},{"t":257.7,"txt":"materials, ensure there are no"},{"t":259.8,"txt":"smoldering materials, and close the"},{"t":262.4,"txt":"permit only after the final inspection."},{"t":265.8,"txt":"Golden safety reminder, think before you"},{"t":268.8,"txt":"strike an arc. Check permit, PPE,"},{"t":273.2,"txt":"fire protection, fire watch, final"},{"t":276.4,"txt":"inspection."},{"t":277.9,"txt":"These six steps are your formula for"},{"t":280,"txt":"safe hot work every time. Remember, one"},{"t":284,"txt":"spark can start a fire."},{"t":286.2,"txt":"One safe decision can prevent it. Be"},{"t":289,"txt":"safe, work safe, go home safe."}],"words":[{"t":0,"w":"Hot"},{"t":0.44,"w":"work"},{"t":0.76,"w":"is"},{"t":0.96,"w":"any"},{"t":1.16,"w":"activity"},{"t":1.76,"w